    "detailed_description": "Gun Miner is a rogue-lite where you must uncover your crashed ship using your massive earth moving riffle. <br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Unlock over 30 weapon variation upgrades<br></li><li>Explore 4 unique environments<br></li><li>Blast through a wild menagerie of enemies</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore</h2>Shoot through rocks, ore, and gravel to dive deep into caverns crawling with vile creatures. The world contains 4 unique biomes each with their own beasts and hazards.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213100/extras/1428d7897196f4ae9d24e0a2c291a570.avif?t=1663471247\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Upgrade</h2>At the start your gun can only cut into weak shale. But find ore and craft upgrades to get more powerful weapons such as cluster bombs, micro-nukes, and guided missiles. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213100/extras/f8992aec7bb68cf200cc331a3f84efe3.avif?t=1663471247\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle</h2>Use a combination of weapons to exploit enemy weakpoints.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213100/extras/86ce5a37313c8438d0cbffaf5196df11.avif?t=1663471247\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Perfect Controls</h2>Dodge and attack enemies with fluid, pixel perfect controls.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1213100/extras/da7fd999e8d8730d925302f2b0bf85a6.avif?t=1663471247\" /></div>",
